WEBVTT

1
00:00:00.600 --> 00:00:02.450
Every feature gets its own First Mate.

2
00:00:02.720 --> 00:00:05.770
Tell it what you want to achieve, and it shapes the next
step with you.

3
00:00:06.040 --> 00:00:10.200
Planning, implementation, and review happen in
independent agent sessions.

4
00:00:10.510 --> 00:00:13.170
Your First Mate stays here, ready for your next question.

5
00:00:13.400 --> 00:00:16.320
The workspace shows what is running and where the
evidence lives.

6
00:00:16.500 --> 00:00:18.740
When a major step finishes, the work pauses.

7
00:00:18.990 --> 00:00:21.650
First Mate brings you a clear result and a
recommendation.

8
00:00:22.050 --> 00:00:24.650
You choose what comes next, in your own words.
